{"thread":{"threadID":3030,"boardID":117,"topic":"Spenden / Donate absofort möglich","time":1444161792,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","lastPostTime":1444250286,"lastPoster":"Zeschter","replies":8,"views":774,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":6},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":38348,"threadID":3030,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"Spenden / Donate absofort möglich","time":1444161792,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":6,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1902,"username":"Sutitchi","time":1444161897,"value":1},{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1444162720,"value":1},{"userID":1904,"username":"MaDNeZ","time":1444163021,"value":1},{"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","time":1444163598,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1444163966,"value":1},{"userID":1599,"username":"Abendstille","time":1444169977,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"></div><p>Aufgrund der hohen Anfragen bezüglich Donating und der Tatsache das wir in den letzten Monaten etwas finanzielle Probleme haben, ist es absofort möglich für die Community via. Paypal zu spenden.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das ganze dient dazu die Community langstmöglich am Leben zu halten. Wenn ein User/Member Dream helfen möchte, kann er dies nun anhand einer Spende. Vorteile werden durch eine getätigte Spende nicht erreicht. Wir wollen nach-wie-vor das sich Spieler keine Features erkaufen können und man dadurch gedrängt wird sein Geld auszugeben. Man bekommt im Forum den Rang &quot;Donator&quot; das war es auch schon.<br>Das ganze soll auf freiwilliger Basis basieren und auch so bleiben.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Jeder der einen Betrag gespendet hat wird in der Liste angezeigt.<br>Man kann bestimmen ob bei einer Spende in der Liste Name oder Betrag zensiert werden soll.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Die Donate Seite ist absofort in der Navigationsleiste zu finden.<br>Die Spenden-Email lautet: <span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>sky</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38349,"threadID":3030,"userID":1860,"username":"MaikDieENTE","subject":"","time":1444162883,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Warum nur PayPal?:D Handyguthaben? PSC? (glaub ich direkt einfach code geben)?!?!!+<br>MfG Duckyyy</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38350,"threadID":3030,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1444162996,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Habe 2€ Donatet :3</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38351,"threadID":3030,"userID":null,"username":"Baumi","subject":"","time":1444163239,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1444191721,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>#70</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38352,"threadID":3030,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1444163612,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Paypal restricted, aber #Donate kommt noch <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38359,"threadID":3030,"userID":1841,"username":"Max <3","subject":"","time":1444193580,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1791-pixel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Pixel</a> eventuell wirst du endlich Admin wenn du Donatest xD</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38360,"threadID":3030,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1444199